---
// Isotipo AV de Athletic Vault (monograma A + V)
// color: relleno del monograma
const { color = "#0a0a0a", height = 30 }: { color?: string; height?: number } = Astro.props;
---
<span class="mark" aria-hidden="true">
  <svg viewBox="0 0 146 100" fill={color} style={`height:${height}px;width:auto`} role="img" aria-label="Athletic Vault">
    <path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M55 10 L92 90 H74 L66 70 H44 L36 90 H18 Z M55 30 L64 58 H46 Z" />
    <path d="M78 10 H96 L112 60 L128 10 H146 L118 90 H106 Z" />
  </svg>
</span>
